insert into job_collabs (id, poster_id, type, title, body, trade, location, scheduled_date, pay_type, filled_at, created_at, seed_batch_id) values
  ('e6d27fb6-e8fd-5033-bc43-6367e47b287f', 'dfb0e5bf-fb0b-52d1-b931-e53488254b99', 'extra_hand', 'Extra set of hands Sat for a boiler swap in Clifton. 8 hrs, day rate, you learn', 'Swapping an old cast iron boiler in a two-family in Clifton Saturday. Rigging the old one out of the basement is the worst part, so I need a strong back first and a brain second. 7am start, figure 8 hours, maybe 9. Day rate, paid at the end of the day, and I''ll show you how the near-boiler piping goes together while we do it.

You don''t need to know boilers, kid. You need to show up on time with boots and gloves and not be on your phone. That''s the job.', 'plumbing', 'Clifton, NJ', '2026-08-15', 'day_rate', '2026-08-13T23:15:10+00:00', '2026-08-10T01:43:23+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('fd49d452-f5a3-5cee-a31c-4e68a0a33f76', '688739f6-9783-5e53-a5b2-f60373e11c3f', 'extra_hand', 'One helper for a week on a school unit-ventilator job, Willingboro', 'We are replacing classroom unit ventilators in a school in Willingboro the week of August 3, while the building is empty. I need one helper for the week: carrying, demo, cleaning up, staging the new units. 6:00 start, and I mean 6:00.

Here''s what I look for when I hire: you show up, you listen, you don''t need to be told twice. This is a public job, so you would be on our certified payroll for the week at the rate set for the classification, and the district requires a background check before you set foot in the building. I''ll walk whoever I pick through both.', 'hvac', 'Willingboro, NJ', '2026-08-03', 'day_rate', '2026-08-03T00:34:59+00:00', '2026-07-28T00:18:29+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('8946d40f-7638-5e69-80ab-742cfc7bdbc4', '7a6f6003-76c1-5962-a01c-a6cddfc8f26b', 'extra_hand', 'Extra hand Saturday: rewire on a raised house in Long Branch, day rate', 'Honestly this one is a classic shore job. House got raised after Sandy, the electrical got "temporarily" reconnected by somebody years ago, and now we''re doing it right. Saturday, all day. I need a helper to pull wire, drill, and keep the job clean while I do the panel side.

Day rate. You''ll be up and down ladders and in a crawlspace that''s more of a crawl than a space. If you''ve only done new construction, that''s fine, this is a good look at what remodel work actually is.', 'electrical', 'Long Branch, NJ', '2026-08-15', 'day_rate', '2026-08-14T01:55:27+00:00', '2026-08-09T23:29:15+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('2f10837e-39aa-53e2-8dd7-b2dc1059c362', '98e78eb6-decf-5515-a59c-8be11a84fa4d', 'ride_along', 'Shadow a service tech for a week, Camden County (week of Aug 17)', 'So this one time in AC... I spent my whole first summer carrying condensers and never once saw anybody actually diagnose anything lol. Not doing that to the next guy.

I''ve got a week of service calls around Cherry Hill, Voorhees and Pennsauken starting Monday the 17th. Ride along, watch how a no-cool call goes from the door to the invoice, ask questions in the van not in front of the customer... You''ll carry stuff too, that''s the deal. Unpaid, it''s a shadow week, but I''ll buy the Wawa.', 'hvac', 'Cherry Hill, NJ', '2026-08-17', 'unpaid', '2026-08-16T23:19:27+00:00', '2026-08-10T16:06:33+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('256e9ae6-d106-5aa7-bb1e-290dd05d19bc', 'f84fe0e8-873f-58b7-9893-f236cf66d827', 'extra_hand', 'Helper for 3 days on a riser job in Jersey City', 'Replacing a section of domestic water riser in a six-story co-op, Jersey City. Three days starting Wednesday the 19th. You''d be carrying, cutting, staging, and dealing with residents who want to know when their water comes back. Day rate.

Tell me in two lines what you''ve done and whether you can be there at 7. That''s all I need to know.', 'plumbing', 'Jersey City, NJ', '2026-08-19', 'day_rate', '2026-08-14T10:09:05+00:00', '2026-08-13T00:32:26+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('06228283-7d50-5d7c-9f0f-d66b7dff824e', '6a71c949-16d2-52fe-9c8c-0a623c8c3e66', 'extra_hand', 'Helper needed: heat pump install, Edison, 2 days', 'Ducted heat pump replacing an old oil furnace, Edison split-level. Two days, Tuesday and Wednesday.
- Day 1: removal, pad, line set, air handler
- Day 2: wiring with the electrician, startup, cleanup
- Day rate, start 7:30
- You will carry a lot and you will clean up more than you think
- I explain the rebate paperwork at lunch for anyone who wants it

Callbacks cost me more than labor does, so I care more about careful than fast.', 'hvac', 'Edison, NJ', '2026-08-18', 'day_rate', '2026-08-17T22:55:05+00:00', '2026-08-11T01:09:07+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('363d4324-a51b-5746-a6fc-c96e1bab3fec', 'c550f38e-1f91-59eb-8c3f-2566dca5af92', 'extra_hand', 'Saturday of water heater swaps around Kearny, need an extra hand', 'Three water heaters booked for one Saturday, Kearny and Harrison. My father used to say you can tell a plumber by how he leaves a basement, so the job is half install, half cleanup. Draining, carrying the old tanks up, hauling, and I''ll let you do a connection or two if you''ve done them before.

Day rate. I was a helper like this once and I remember who treated me right. I try to be that guy.', 'plumbing', 'Kearny, NJ', '2026-08-22', 'day_rate', '2026-08-20T00:20:54+00:00', '2026-08-17T01:04:56+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('c11bde54-c8bd-5891-a35d-2e3e8e6d4d0b', 'c588b587-bf00-57ce-81f7-e7c7089fe77a', 'extra_hand', 'Helper for a gas test + inspection day, Bay Ridge brownstone', 'In the city it''s different: on a gas job the inspection day is its own day. We finished a new gas line in a Bay Ridge brownstone and I need a helper on Thursday the 27th for the pressure test, tagging, and standing around while we wait on the inspector. Plus cleanup in the cellar. The inspector decides when he shows up, not me, so bring patience.

Paid by the day or swap it for a Saturday on my next job if you want more hours with me. Your choice.', 'plumbing', 'Bay Ridge, Brooklyn', '2026-08-27', 'flexible', '2026-08-26T23:10:58+00:00', '2026-08-21T00:50:53+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('c82e59b7-4812-537a-a43d-d289ca2de16a', 'dfa0289e-7f8a-53dc-8191-16f6fb52934f', 'extra_hand', 'Saturday mini-split install in Wayne, one helper', 'Doing a two-zone ductless install on a Cape in Wayne on Saturday, the 29th. One helper. First, you''ll help me plan the line set route, because that''s where every bad install starts. Second, you''ll do the core drilling with me, and third you''ll watch the vacuum and the startup, not just hand me tools.

Day rate. Ask me how I know a helper who''s never seen a micron gauge learns more in one Saturday than a week of slides.', 'hvac', 'Wayne, NJ', '2026-08-29', 'day_rate', '2026-08-29T00:44:37+00:00', '2026-08-24T00:07:23+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('ca9045e2-b36d-5766-9cf5-e03eb8b474a4', 'd564dd78-7316-5c47-b918-c6f2fba61791', 'ride_along', 'Ride-along for a Junior interested in commercial: Secaucus fit-out, 2 days', 'We are in the middle of a large commercial fit-out in Secaucus and I can bring one Junior along for two days (Tuesday and Wednesday) to see how a commercial job runs: the morning huddle, lockout/tagout on a live building, how a crew splits up the work.

You will watch, carry, and ask questions on breaks. You will not work on anything energized. Hard hat, safety glasses, gloves and boots are required; the GC also needs your name a few days ahead for a site badge, so I can only take someone who answers quickly. Stay safe.', 'electrical', 'Secaucus, NJ', '2026-09-01', 'unpaid', '2026-09-01T01:42:45+00:00', '2026-08-27T00:32:16+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('3b08238a-bc5c-51f6-b732-9ed98c51dfaf', 'fd687687-b565-5339-995d-3a85eb69c2f8', 'ride_along', 'shadow a controls tech for a day, bms service calls around bridgewater', 'my company''s ok with me bringing someone along for a day of building automation service, thursday the 10th. two or three office buildings around bridgewater and somerville: chasing a dead bacnet trunk, swapping a controller, some front-end work on the laptop.

fwiw low voltage is a real trade and a lot of people only find out it exists when they''re 10 years into something else. unpaid, it''s a look-see day. bring a notebook, not a tool bag', 'electrical', 'Bridgewater, NJ', '2026-09-10', 'unpaid', '2026-09-09T23:59:35+00:00', '2026-09-03T01:40:46+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('76c4cef0-7256-5d19-ac33-a3f600bcefea', '688739f6-9783-5e53-a5b2-f60373e11c3f', 'extra_hand', 'Extra hand Saturday: restroom rough-in at a warehouse, Mount Laurel', 'Private job this time, no certified payroll: a warehouse adding a restroom group in Mount Laurel. Saturday the 12th, 6:30 start. We will be laying out and roughing in the waste and vent, so you will be cutting, carrying, and holding a level for a while.

Day rate. Here''s what I look for when I hire: shows up on time, listens, doesn''t need to be told twice. If you have a few years in and want to see commercial rough-in, say so in your pitch.', 'plumbing', 'Mount Laurel, NJ', '2026-09-12', 'day_rate', '2026-09-12T01:30:35+00:00', '2026-09-04T01:20:18+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('3388e9b2-4fc1-5d05-81fc-3d0838647512', 'f84fe0e8-873f-58b7-9893-f236cf66d827', 'extra_hand', 'Saturday helper, boiler room cleanup and new feed in a Hoboken co-op', 'Co-op building in Hoboken. Saturday the 19th. We''re cleaning up a boiler room nobody has touched in years and running a new feed line. Dirty, hot, and you''ll carry everything down a narrow stairwell. Day rate.

What I need to know: what you''ve done, and can you be there at 7. Parking is your problem, sorry.', 'plumbing', 'Hoboken, NJ', '2026-09-19', 'day_rate', '2026-09-19T00:09:33+00:00', '2026-09-13T22:53:43+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('53cd68a3-ec5c-5aed-9433-3ee106cbab1d', '889c860e-644c-5ba0-8dcd-6de744328e67', 'ride_along', 'ride along on walk-in calls, atlantic city, end of season', 'boardwalk''s winding down so the walk-ins and reach-ins that limped through july are finally getting fixed. tuesday the 15th, three or four restaurant calls in ac. you watch, you hold the light, you learn why a walk-in ices up. winter is when you learn, but september''s not bad either.

unpaid. no sandals. its going to smell like a dumpster at least once', 'hvac', 'Atlantic City, NJ', '2026-09-15', 'unpaid', '2026-09-14T22:07:28+00:00', '2026-09-09T01:59:06+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('d5cddc50-e91d-5484-bfd2-8ab89d9087e9', '7a6f6003-76c1-5962-a01c-a6cddfc8f26b', 'extra_hand', 'Helper for a service upgrade on a raised house in Sea Bright', 'Another shore one. Raised house in Sea Bright, the meter and service got moved up after Sandy and now the owner wants a real panel and a generator inlet. Monday, all day, maybe a few hours Tuesday. Honestly it''s a good one to see if you''ve never watched a service upgrade from start to finish.

Day rate. Ladders, a lot of them. Bring a harness if you have one, I have a spare if you don''t.', 'electrical', 'Sea Bright, NJ', '2026-09-21', 'day_rate', '2026-09-21T00:22:55+00:00', '2026-09-15T01:02:03+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('e844addf-8cb0-5613-bf51-2cd825d207d0', 'dfa0289e-7f8a-53dc-8191-16f6fb52934f', 'ride_along', 'Ride-along Sunday: load calc and duct survey on a Clifton Cape', 'Sunday the 20th I''m doing a heat-loss calc and a duct survey on a Cape in Clifton, for a homeowner who wants to know if a heat pump will keep up in January. Bring a notebook. First, we measure every room. Second, we look at the ductwork in the attic, which will be ugly. Third, I''ll show you how the numbers turn into equipment size.

Unpaid, it''s a learning day, but it''s the part of HVAC nobody teaches you on the job. Ask me how I know.', 'hvac', 'Clifton, NJ', '2026-09-20', 'unpaid', '2026-09-19T00:27:45+00:00', '2026-09-13T10:00:43+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('967e99a6-519f-5a22-a394-9ae4f8f8bb86', 'dfb0e5bf-fb0b-52d1-b931-e53488254b99', 'extra_hand', 'Steam job in Garfield Saturday: need someone who isn''t afraid of a basement', 'One-pipe steam system in a Garfield two-family that hasn''t heated right since the owner''s father died. We''re replacing vents, skimming the boiler, and fixing pitch on a couple of runs in a basement with 6 feet of headroom on a good day. Saturday, 7am.

Day rate. If you''ve never seen steam, this is how you learn it, kid: in a dirty basement with somebody who''s done it for 28 years. That''s the job.', 'plumbing', 'Garfield, NJ', '2026-09-26', 'day_rate', '2026-09-26T00:53:46+00:00', '2026-09-17T22:29:01+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('42668d61-a9ac-5f2d-a38f-dd82d3cac763', 'c550f38e-1f91-59eb-8c3f-2566dca5af92', 'ride_along', 'Ride-along week at a small shop in Kearny, for a vo-tech grad', 'I hire out of the county vo-techs and I''ve learned the hard way that a kid doesn''t know if he wants a small shop until he''s done a week in one. So: ride along with my trucks Monday the 28th through Friday. Service calls, a water heater, a repipe if it holds. You''ll see the phone ring and the schedule fall apart by 10am, which is the real lesson.

Paid for the days you work, or count it as a tryout. My father hired me this way. I want to do it right.', 'plumbing', 'Kearny, NJ', '2026-09-28', 'flexible', '2026-09-28T00:20:33+00:00', '2026-09-22T23:14:18+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('cd550a3d-a4f5-5fce-a206-22ec472f8a6e', '98e78eb6-decf-5515-a59c-8be11a84fa4d', 'specialist', 'Need someone with their 608 for a rooftop PM day in AC', 'Fall PM day on rooftop units at a hotel in Atlantic City, Tuesday the 29th. I need a second set of hands who can legally handle refrigerant, so you need your 608 card, Type II or Universal. Filters, belts, coil cleaning, and checking charge on a couple that are acting up...

So this one time in AC I had a helper show up without his card and I had to send him back down to sit in the van lol. Bring the card. Paid by the day, or trade for a day on a no-heat call this winter if you''d rather learn than earn.', 'hvac', 'Atlantic City, NJ', '2026-09-29', 'flexible', '2026-09-29T00:08:23+00:00', '2026-09-24T16:56:16+00:00', 'fm-2026-10'),
  ('90560533-bfc3-5c34-82d6-b01ecbecd49f', '6a71c949-16d2-52fe-9c8c-0a623c8c3e66', 'specialist', 'Need a 608-certified helper for recovery on two changeouts, South Brunswick', 'Two heat pump changeouts on the same street in South Brunswick, Thursday October 1. I need someone who can handle recovery while my lead does the installs.
- EPA 608 required (Type II or Universal)
- Recovery machine and tanks provided; bring your gauges if you have them
- Day rate, 7:30 start
- I''ll check your card before you touch a valve

Paperwork matters on these: recovered pounds go on the job sheet, every time.', 'hvac', 'South Brunswick, NJ', '2026-10-01', 'day_rate', '2026-10-01T00:00:48+00:00', '2026-09-25T00:02:55+00:00', 'fm-2026-10');
